  "introduction": "Consolidate primary mathematics and prepare for secondary study through scale drawings and maps.",
  "definition": "A scale is the ratio of drawing length to actual length in the same units. A scale of 1:n means one drawing unit represents n actual units. Multiply drawing length by n to find actual length and divide actual length by n to find drawing length.",
